# Throwaway screenshots: `python tests/shots.py <url> _live` and the plausibility
# pass write these wherever they are run from. Nothing reads them, and a `git add
# -A` once swept 2.9 MB of them into this repo (#61). No slash, so both the app
# root and tests/ are covered.
_live*.png
_plaus*.png
