# (`python generate_letters.py --rerender`, ~6s, no model calls). Tracking them
# put 5.8 MB into this repo's history every time the timeline was rebuilt, so
# the deploy mirror renders them at push time instead — see tools/mirror.py.
letters/*.pdf
